# Tao Agent OS managed Claude agent
name: tao_worker
description: Implement one disjoint, parent-assigned slice and run its focused checks. Use only when a parent agent assigns explicit owned and forbidden paths with a ready handoff, not for general implementation requests.
model: inherit
